# Local reference captures (not part of the site)
/n*.png
/ref*.png

# Original fonts (.otf/.ttf). The ones the site uses are already converted in
# src/app/fonts/; the script that converted them (install-fonts.mjs) no longer
# exists. They moved to _interno/fuentes/ on 2026-09-23; the rule stays in
# case they come back.
public/fonts/_drop/

# Client media originals (681 MB). Input for `npm run media`; what gets
# versioned are the derivatives in public/images/venue and public/videos.
public/multimedia/

# Working captures from the redesign. The DELIVERABLES (baseline/, after/,
# COMPARE-*.png, specimen-*.png) are versioned; these are intermediate and are
# regenerated with the design-audit/ scripts.
design-audit/fase*/
design-audit/HOJA-*.png
design-audit/tmp/
design-audit/specimen.html

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INTERNAL CLIENT MATERIAL. NEVER UPLOADED.
# This is where the brief PDFs, the brand book, the moodboard and any file
# with client data (emails, phone numbers, fees, budgets) go. Camila's rule,
# 2026-09-11: if it's the client's or it's our internal working material, it
# lives here and never goes into git.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/_interno/

# Raw dump of the current Wix site. Reference material, NOT published or
# versioned: it is the ORIGINAL, and it contains the client's event prices and
# an internal email (see _interno/LEEME.md and docs/INVARIANTS.md §5b). What
# gets versioned is the derivative: the data transcribed into content/*.ts.
# Regenerated with design-audit/tmp/scrape-wix.mjs
src/content/_source/

# `next dev` log when it is run to a file. Local artifact.
dev-server.log

# Operating system junk. `desktop.ini` is Windows folder customization: it got
# in by mistake in 5e34c6e and was removed on 2026-09-23.
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
